      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A downward shift of the d-band center weakens adsorption of poisoning intermediates such as CO.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Weaker adsorption of poisoning intermediates changes the ethanol-oxidation reaction pathway.",
      "field": "hypothesis; mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The altered reaction pathway suppresses undesired side reactions.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The altered pathway favors desired products such as acetic acid over undesirable side products.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ru-enriched catalysts will have higher selectivity toward desired ethanol-oxidation products than the nominally equiatomic catalyst.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ru-enriched catalysts will exhibit reduced poisoning-related species relative to the nominally equiatomic catalyst.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed effect should hold between 20 and 80 degrees Celsius.",
      "field": "conditions; boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
